   "source": [
    "Bayes Theorm\n",
    "\n",
    "P(A) pior probability of A\n",
    "P(B|A) - Probability of evidence B when A is true\n",
    "P(B) - Overall Probabilty of evidence B\n",
    "P(A|B) - Posterior Probability - Probability A after seeing B\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "fffd257d-fc91-458b-a373-8599fd5a769d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1% of people have a disease -> P(D) = 0.01\n",
    "Test correctly detects the disease 95% of the time -> P(Positive | D) = 0.95\n",
    "5% if healthy people also test positive -> P(Positive | No D) = 0.05"
   ]
  },
